que no se mueva, por favor?

1681
01:31:41,162 --> 01:31:42,663
- No, no, no.
- Dile al piloto...

1682
01:31:42,665 --> 01:31:44,330
Dile al piloto que se vaya,

1683
01:31:44,332 --> 01:31:46,098
